invalid type: string "Meeting Notes \n \nDate: October 5, 2026 \n \nProject: Student Management System \n \nAttendees: \nAthiya, Rahul, Sara and Ahmed \n \nDiscussion: \nThe team discussed the progress of the student management system. \nRahul completed the login module. \nSara will test the login module. \nAthiya will prepare the database design. \nAhmed will work on the dashboard. \n \n856,0.158